00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:59,600
So we've got a number of drivers that are either available for a given application.

321
00:27:59,600 --> 00:28:08,600
So the example we'll take a look at is Jenkins, but we do have access to our generic driver as well for CI CD integration.

322
00:28:08,600 --> 00:28:12,600
The process and results is very similar. And we'll take a look at that in a sec.

323
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:19,600
But typically, as long as that pipeline is capable of running Java, you should be able to use that generic driver for any of your platforms.

