00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:44,600
So we want to utilize our Burp Suite Enterprise scanner, but we want to initiate these scans from Jenkins itself.

327
00:28:44,600 --> 00:28:50,600
So you can download the plugin from our website. This is absolutely available and testable as part of the POC and trial as well.

