00:30:53,600 --> 00:30:57,600
But the driver gives us that link between Jenkins and Enterprise.

352
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,600
So we know the status of the scan at all times.

353
00:30:59,600 --> 00:31:03,600
So we can fail the build as and when required.

